  "title": "Lua: Improved API for obtaining fields",
  "description": "This extends existing all_field_infos() API by a parameter to specify\nthe wanted fields by their id or their filter name.\n\nSecondly it introduces a new API Field.get_id() to obtain the field id\nof a field given its filter name.\n\nThis can result in better performance as the user can request field\ninfos in a more specific way and conversions of unnecessary  fields are\navoided.\n\nThis becomes useful when you expect the same field multiple times in a\nframe.",
